- [Function calling & Tools](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/function-calling.md): Learn how to make models select functions to extend their capabilities
- [Structured output & JSON](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/json.md): Learn how to get structured output from our text models
- [Rate Limits & Scaling](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/rate-limits.md): Learn how rate limiting of requests works and what are the scaling rules
