t.\\nDedicated GPUs, post-training, and workload optimization when you scale.\\nStart in minutes. Engineer it for production when it matters.\",\"background\":{\"image\":\"files.dev-header-tf\",\"color\":\"#D4FC50\"},\"resetPaddings\":true,\"verticalOffset\":\"l\",\"buttons\":[{\"text\":\"Quick start\",\"theme\":\"accent\",\"size\":\"promo\",\"url\":\"https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/quickstart\"},{\"text\":\"Docs\",\"theme\":\"normal\",\"size\":\"promo\",\"url\":\"https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/\"}]},{\"type\":\"card-layout-block\",\"title\":\"Build. Customize. Optimize. Deploy\",\"description\":\"\",\"colSizes\":{\"all\":12,\"sm\":6,\"md\":6,\"lg\":3,\"xl\":3},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"basic-card\",\"title\":\"Start building\",\"text\":\"\\n* [Quickstart](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/quickstart){target:_blank}\\n* [API reference](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/overview){target:_blank}\\n* [Playground](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/playground){target:_blank}\\n\\n* [Switch to Token Factory](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/switch){target:_blank}\",\"border\":\"line\"},{\"type\":\"basic-card\",\"title\":\"Optimize for real workloads\",\"text\":\"\\n* [Dedicated endpoints](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/dedicated-endpoints){target:_blank}\\n* [Autoscaling and cache-aware routing](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/rate-limits){target:_blank}\\n* [Batch inference](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/ai-models-inference/batch-inference){target:_blank}\",\"border\":\"line\"},{\"type\":\"basic-card\",\"title\":\"Customize the model\",\"text\":\"\\n* [Post-training guide](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/post-training/overview#overview){target:_blank}\\n* [Deploy custom models](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/post-training/deploy-custom-model){target:_blank}\\n* [Post-training examples](https://github.com/nebius/token-factory-cookbook/tree/main/post-training){target:_blank}\\n\",\"border\":\"line\"},{\"type\":\"basic-card\",\"title\":\"Integrate with your stack\",\"text\":\"\\n* APIs: [LiteLLM](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/api/litellm){target:_blank}, [Aisuite](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/api/aisuite){target:_blank}, and [more](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/overview#apis){target:_blank}\\n* Frameworks: [LlamaIndex](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/frameworks/llama-index/overview){target:_blank}, [Langchain](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/frameworks/langchain){target:_blank}\\n* Agents: [Agno](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/agents/agno){target:_blank}, [Crew AI](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/agents/crewai){target:_blank}, [Pydantic](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/agents/pydantic){target:_blank}, and [more](https://docs.tokenfactory.nebius.com/integrations/overview#agent-frameworks){target:_blank}\",\"border\":\"line\"}]},{\"type\":\"card-layout-block\",\"title\":\"Architecture and build walkthroughs\",\"colSizes\":{\"md\":6,\"lg\":6,\"xl\":6},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"background-card\",\"theme\":\"dark\",\"title\":\"Official Token Factory playlist on YouTube\",\"text\":\"Learn about Nebius Token Factory from the makers\",\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"background\":{\"src\":\"files.youtube-cover-1\"},\"paddingBottom\":\"s\",\"controlPosition\":\"footer\",\"buttons\":[{\"text\":\"Go to playlist\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLB6z9TepeSqlZ_4dd9_Y7qQMthezdXL3D\",\"theme\":\"normal-contrast\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}]},{\"type\":\"background-card\",\"theme\":\"dark\",\"title\":\"Build with Token Factory playlist on YouTube\",\"text\":\"Discover AI projects, tools, and success stories created with Token Factory.\",\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"background\":{\"src\":\"files.youtube-cover-2\"},\"paddingBottom\":\"s\",\"controlPosition\":\"footer\",\"buttons\":[{\"text\":